---
title: Travel Reading Recommendations
description: Travel reading recommendations grouped by trip and location.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /travel-books/index.html
isTravelBooks: true
---
<section class="opening" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="measure">
    <p class="kicker">Reading Recommendations</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Travel Reading Recommendations</h1>
    <p class="lede">I like to read about the history of places I travel to.</p>
    <p class="lede">The following is a beginnging of a list of books I read during various trips. This is just a simple list for now, but I plan to add some observations in the future.</p>
  
  </div>
</section>

<div class="book-groups measure">
  {% for group in travelBooks.groups %}
    <section class="book-group" aria-labelledby="book-group-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 id="book-group-{{ loop.index }}">{{ group.trip }}</h2>
      <ul class="book-list">
        {% for book in group.books %}
          <li><em>{{ book.title }}</em>{% if book.author %} — {{ book.author }}{% endif %}{% if book.year %} ({{ book.year }}){% endif %}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% else %}
    <p>No travel books have been added yet.</p>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
